    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/70897ed8a43b8658f4f255acb0350ebb.avif?t=1714592403\" /></span><br>Bubble Blaster is a Sci-fi Shooter game where you need to face giant bubble Gums!<br>Make the Bubbles return to the machine before the time limit, the faster, the better your placement on the leaderboards!<br>You must have bought a gum from a vending machine before... Insert a coin, turn the lever, and voil\u00e0, you received your gum, but what if now, radiations and anomalous events had enlarged and animated the bubble gums?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.poster.avif?t=1714592403\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.webm?t=1714592403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.mp4?t=1714592403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These giant and voracious bubble gums are now called Bubble Blasters, and your job is to control this threat! Make them enter the portal of the BSB Machine where they will be detained.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/1d3e855fcbe8ae3f23cb47be7a88ad16.avif?t=1714592403\" /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/70897ed8a43b8658f4f255acb0350ebb.avif?t=1714592403\" /></span><br>Bubble Blaster is a Sci-fi Shooter game where you need to face giant bubble Gums!<br>Make the Bubbles return to the machine before the time limit, the faster, the better your placement on the leaderboards!<br>You must have bought a gum from a vending machine before... Insert a coin, turn the lever, and voil\u00e0, you received your gum, but what if now, radiations and anomalous events had enlarged and animated the bubble gums?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.poster.avif?t=1714592403\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.webm?t=1714592403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/ee7628ed5e25ae25cd142b75fc16b7d3.mp4?t=1714592403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These giant and voracious bubble gums are now called Bubble Blasters, and your job is to control this threat! Make them enter the portal of the BSB Machine where they will be detained.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500290/extras/1d3e855fcbe8ae3f23cb47be7a88ad16.avif?t=1714592403\" /></span></h2>",
